// m07 · THE NEIGHBOURS (ch07) · D minor → G (celld's town) → A-sus4 (the shut door) → D open fifth
//   s01  alone in the hold: the harbour drone under the iris and a D minor pad; a soft page-turn pulse for each
//        scroll laid (pizzicato D–A), stopped dead on 'cold', resuming for 'Pages are laid down again'; T on 'back'.
